{"v":4,"catch":"騎在 Chameneon 的霓虹燈小徑！","desc":"Chameneon 是一款 2D 平台遊戲/跑步遊戲，具有令人難以置信的多彩和美麗的像素藝術。 在遊戲中，病毒感染了 Cyber Space，現在由您啟動協議 CHAMENEON。 在網絡空間的霓虹線上沖浪並在為時已晚之前擊敗病毒。\n\n憑藉獨特的物理特性，Chameneon 創造了一個巨大的挑戰，需要良好的精度和反應才能超越它。 通過簡單而殘酷的遊戲玩法和大量的關卡，您將受到極限考驗！\n\n奔跑、跳躍、躲避和收集霓虹燈盤，向所有人展示誰才是老大。 是時候讓您煥發光彩了！\n\n特徵：\n- 玩過 80 個關卡\n- 4種不同的環境\n- 輕鬆直觀的遊戲玩法\n- 一隻可愛的貓來幫忙\n\n\nBurning Goat Studios 開發，QUByte Interactive 發行","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["動作","街機","音樂","派對"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c28602addfc913eab59e4dcddd77dc3f419da5d672ced4011ec1ef2c7ca5ae60.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/96e3298d0738dae0e939da50b6e45c3d129e67f8857e1f2cd7065bf8de84547c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fa426edc65c031242b9705563abbda88dbe3d5717e9c41ebb7f27a018ae7ee1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f20308d3b12389b73e6e43cabc73677b8b77161b8599c09b194f542b26aef7b3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9d086a4960cc0aa266919d03b51a82cbab7a26baafbd848b38f14cc4d5ee6cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/71f16372571714c9edd9b8da65a6a0a194162eb4d09dca29b0310b727e262aca.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a7b018668000","dlc":[]}